OL,3,GNEWSA'Serious situation' as E. coli
OL,4,Aspikes in river
OL,5,
OL,6,FE. coli levels have "spiked alarmingly"
OL,7,Fin a river, according to an
OL,8,Fenvironmental group that carries out
OL,9,Fregular monitoring.
OL,11,FChristchurch Harbour and Marine Society
OL,12,F(Chams) has been regularly testing for
OL,13,Fthe bacteria in the Avon and the Stour
OL,14,Fin Dorset for a year.
OL,16,FIts figures show E. coli levels in the
OL,17,FStour peaked on 19 August at 370,000 E.
OL,18,Fcoli colony-forming units (cfu)/100ml
OL,19,Fof water compared with 4,217 E. coli
OL,20,Fcfu/100ml for the same week in 2025.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
