OL,3,GNEWSA'Serious situation' as E. coli
OL,4,Aspikes in river
OL,5,
OL,6,FChams chair Martin Stewart said: "I am
OL,7,Fbeing fed details of cases of illness
OL,8,Fwhere people have been in the water and
OL,9,Fending up in Bournemouth Hospital. It's
OL,10,Fa serious situation." The Environment
OL,11,FAgency said it had begun its own
OL,12,Finvestigations.
